.TH ZERODDS-IDLC 1 "2026-05-06" "1.0.0-rc.1" "ZeroDDS Manual"
.SH NAME
zerodds-idlc \- IDL compiler producing Rust/C++/Java/C#/Python/TypeScript code
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zerodds-idlc
[\fB\-l\fR \fILANG\fR]
[\fB\-o\fR \fIDIR\fR]
[\fB\-I\fR \fIDIR\fR]
.I FILE.idl
.SH DESCRIPTION
Parses OMG IDL 4.2 and emits target-language data-types plus DDS
TypeSupport. Targets:
.IR rust ", " cpp ", " java ", " csharp ", " python ", " typescript .
Implements the language PSMs (DDS-Java-PSM, DDS-PSM-Cxx, etc.).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-lang =\fILANG\fR
Output language. Multiple
.B \-l
flags allowed.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-out =\fIDIR\fR
Destination directory.
.TP
.BR \-I ", " \-\-include =\fIDIR\fR
Add IDL search path.
.TP
.B \-\-feature =\fIFLAG\fR
Toggle optional spec features (annotations,
.BR \-Wbitset ", " \-Wvaluetype ).
.SH FILES
Generated files follow the per-PSM path conventions, e.g. for Rust
.IR <out>/<module>/<type>.rs .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zerodds-typeobject (1),
.BR zerodds-xmlc (1).
.SH AUTHORS
ZeroDDS Contributors.
